      "settings": {
        "section_id": "results",
        "modifier": "mi-hair",
        "heading": "<h2>You’ve tried what sits on top. This goes below.</h2>",
        "text": "<p>If your part is widening or your ponytail feels thinner, you’ve probably already tried the shampoos, the supplements and the serums. Micro-Infusion Pro uses the same microneedling technique as in-clinic scalp treatments to get serum below the surface, where your scalp can use it.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/mi-pro-hair.webp",
        "image_mobile": "shopify://shop_images/mi-pro-hair-mob.webp"
      }
    },
