      "name": "t:sections.n_mi-overview.name",
      "settings": {
        "use_own_file": false,
        "section_id": "how-it-works",
        "subheader": "How it works",
        "heading": "Go beyond surface-level skincare",
        "wistia_url": "4lvki730al",
        "wistia_url_mobile": "jhwgazmjv8",
        "text": "<p>You’ve probably tried the serums, the topicals everyone swore by. Most of them can only work from the surface. <em>Micro-Infusion Pro does a different job.</em>&nbsp;<br/>It stamps straight down onto your scalp, so there’s no rolling or dragging through your hair. Its tiny 0.5mm gold-plated microneedles create channels in the scalp, so the serum goes where your hair grows and not just onto the strands.&nbsp;<br/><em>Part your hair, press, lift, move on. Five minutes, once every 2 weeks.</em></p>",
        "features_heading": "6 Target Areas - 1 Solution"
      }
    },
