            "text": "<p>Pisum Sativum (Pea) Sprout Extract<br/>Helps target the look of thinning, for visibly denser-looking hair.</p><p>Acetyl Tetrapeptide-3 / Clover Flower Extract<br/>Helps improve the appearance of scalp vitality and hair fullness.</p><p>Copper Tripeptide-1<br/>Supports the look of stronger, resilient-looking hair.</p><p>Niacinamide<br/>Helps condition and hydrate the scalp.</p><p>Caffeine<br/>Provides an energizing, invigorating sensation on the scalp.</p><p>Larix / Green Tea / Zinc / Glycine Complex<br/>Helps the scalp look and feel more balanced with regular use.</p><p>Pyrrolidinyl Diaminopyrimidine Oxide<br/>Supports the look of smoother, more resilient-looking strands.</p><p>Dihydroxypropyl Arginine HCl<br/>Supports a smoother, more comfortable-feeling scalp.</p><p><em>Please note that due to innovative updates and changing regulatory guidelines, the ingredient lists provided here may differ slightly from those on our packaging and distributor websites.</em></p>"
